{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001776661","cik":"0001776661","slug":"advantage-solutions-776661","name":"Advantage Solutions Inc.","ticker":"ADV","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"Services-Business Services, NEC","sic":"7389","country":"MO","website":"","listed_years":6.3,"first_annual":"2020-03-30","last_filing":"2026-06-25","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001776661&type=10-K","narrative":{"source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1776661/000119312526088543/0001193125-26-088543-index.htm","source_form":"10-K","source_date":"2026-03-03","business":"Our Company We provide outsourced sales, marketing, merchandising, sampling, and retailer support services to consumer packaged goods (\"CPG\") manufacturers and retailers primarily across North America. Our services are designed to support distribution, retail execution, shopper engagement, and private brand development across both physical and digital commerce environments. We serve more than 4,000 clients across grocery, mass, club, retail pharmacy, convenience, and other channels in over 100,000 retail locations. We operate through three reportable segments: Branded Services, Experiential Services, and Retailer Services. Our revenue model consists of commissions, fee for service arrangements, and cost-plus structures depending on the nature of the engagement. Expenses related to our employees, which we refer to as teammates, are a major component of the costs associated with our servic \u2026","legal":"We are involved in various legal matters that arise in the ordinary course of our business. Some of these legal matters purport or may be determined to be class and/or representative actions or seek substantial damages or penalties. Some of these legal matters 27 relate to disputes regarding acquisitions. In connection with certain of the below matters and other legal matters, we have accrued amounts that we believe are appropriate. There can be no assurance, however, that the below matters and other legal matters will not result in us having to make payments in excess of such accruals or that the below matters or other legal matters will not materially or adversely affect our business, financial position, results of operations, or cash flows. Commercial Matters We have been involved in various litigation matters and arbitrations with respect to commercial matters arising with various vendors, clients and third parties. Employment-Related Matters We have also been involved in various litigation, including purported class or representative actions with respect to matters arising under the U.S. Fair Labor Standards Act, California Labor Code and Private Attorneys General Act. \u2026","legal_material":true},"story":[{"date":"2021-11-18","form":"424B3","label":"Prospectus supplement filed","kind":"finance","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1776661/000094787121001219/0000947871-21-001219-index.htm"},{"date":"2022-04-18","form":"DEF 14A","label":"Proxy statement \u2014 pay, board, votes","kind":"governance","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1776661/000119312522108062/0001193125-22-108062-index.htm"},{"date":"2023-04-24","form":"DEF 14A","label":"Proxy statement \u2014 pay, board, votes","kind":"governance","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1776661/000095017023013933/0000950170-23-013933-index.htm"},{"date":"2023-05-10","form":"S-8","label":"Employee share plan registered","kind":"people","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1776661/000095017023020549/0000950170-23-020549-index.htm"},{"date":"2024-04-23","form":"DEF 14A","label":"Proxy statement \u2014 pay, board, votes","kind":"governance","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1776661/000095017024046885/0000950170-24-046885-index.htm"},{"date":"2024-11-14","form":"SC 13G","label":"Passive 5%+ stake disclosed","kind":"governance","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1776661/0001897612240019